<title>USA: Continental Airlines up after mention.</title>
<headline>Continental Airlines up after mention.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc's stock price rose on Monday after a mention in the financial weekly Barron's said the airline had &quot;plenty of room on the upside.&quot;</p>
<p>Citing &quot;a savvy investor friend,&quot; Barron's said Continental's earnings had turned around. It also cited improving conditions for the airline industry.</p>
<p>Continental's Class B stock rose 1-3/4, or seven percent, to 26-5/8.</p>
